  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Surface Reflection - Mirror


    Mirrors and highly reflective surfaces
    cause severe laser scattering and false depth readings. The scanner may interpret
    the reflection as a continuation of the room, creating ''ghost'' geometry and
    corrupting the point cloud. Mirrors must be covered or treated with scanning
    spray before capturing.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
