  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Featureless Surface Control


    Large, plain white walls lack the visual
    reference points required by the SLAM algorithm. Scanning homogeneous surfaces
    can cause the device to lose spatial awareness, leading to overlapping geometry
    or tracking drift. It is recommended to use artificial scanning targets or add
    temporary visual markers.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
