      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Optimal Walking Pace


    Moving too quickly through the environment
    prevents the scanner from capturing sufficient overlap between frames. This loss
    of data degrades the SLAM algorithm''s accuracy and leads to incomplete 3D meshes.
    Please maintain a slow, steady walking pace of under 0.8 m/s.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
