  m_text: 'Surface Reflection - Refrigerator


    Reflective surfaces bounce the
    scanner''s light (lasers or infrared) in wrong directions. This creates holes,
    noise, or distorted geometry in the final 3D point cloud. The surface must be
    covered or sprayed before scanning.'
