  m_text: Rapid movement through doorways causes a sudden shift in visual features.
    This abrupt change can overwhelm the SLAM algorithm, leading to map misalignment
    or tracking loss. Please proceed slowly and steadily through all room transitions
    to allow the scanner to properly connect both spaces.
