  m_text: 'Lighting Control


    3D scanners and SLAM algorithms rely on visual
    feature tracking to determine position. Insufficient lighting prevents the sensors
    from identifying key points in the environment, resulting in tracking failure
    or distorted maps. Ensure the area is well-lit before scanning.'
