      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Minimum Object Proximity


    Maintaining a minimum distance of 0.5 meters
    from objects is crucial. Approaching too closely exceeds the scanner''s minimum
    focal length, creating blind spots and preventing the laser from properly returning
    to the sensor. Please step back to maintain the optimal data capture range.'
