  m_text: Rapid rotations or jerky scanner movements cause motion blur and feature
    tracking failure. This disrupts the SLAM algorithm, creating misaligned or corrupted
    3D data. Please rotate the device smoothly and steadily to ensure continuous
    and accurate spatial mapping.
