  m_text: Maintaining a minimum distance of 0.5 meters from objects is crucial. Approaching
    too closely exceeds the scanner's minimum focal length, creating blind spots
    and preventing the laser from properly returning to the sensor. Please step back
    to maintain the optimal data capture range.
