  m_text: 'Scanner Safety Distance


    Operating the scanner too close to the user''s
    body causes the sensors to capture the operator instead of the environment, resulting
    in corrupted spatial data. Please maintain a minimum operational distance of
    30 cm between the device and yourself at all times.'
